					"cell_origin": "client",
					"cell_type": "latex_view",
					"source": "\\section*{Cadabra remote control}\n\nWith the \\verb|cdb.remote| python module that ships with Cadabra, it is possible to launch and control a notebook window using a python script. This is used by the Cadabra project to automatically generate tutorial videos."
				}
			],
			"hidden": true,
			"source": "\\section*{Cadabra remote control}\n\nWith the \\verb|cdb.remote| python module that ships with Cadabra, it is possible to launch and control a notebook window using a python script. This is used by the Cadabra project to automatically generate tutorial videos."
