					"source": "\\begin{verbatim}Socket at control channel ws://localhost:40927/69b9e859-320e-4f33-915c-722b2987ebf5\n\nURL ws://localhost:40927/69b9e859-320e-4f33-915c-722b2987ebf5\nStarting thread...\nThread started\nConnecting to control socket ws://localhost:40927/69b9e859-320e-4f33-915c-722b2987ebf5...\nWebsocket handler going into main loop\nConnection open.\nNotebook up and communicating ***\n\\end{verbatim}"
